            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Matt Muller"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very yummy and easy as pie to make. You just need to be by the pot to continually stir. Has a heavenly chocolate flavor and only 428 calories for a large bowl. I highly recommend it.. I make it all the time.",
            "datePublished": "2019-12-18T21:24:00.493Z"
          },
          {
