            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Pegga"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I love how my champorado turned out. I topped it with cottage cheese, the saltiness balanced out the sweetness of the champorado. I also toasted my sweet glutinous rice because I like the toasty aroma",
            "datePublished": "2019-11-24T04:44:13.967Z"
          },
          {
