            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Joanna Lynne Cortina"
            },
            "reviewBody": "FOr those of you people saying it is too thick, it is supposed to be like that. Before you eat it, I always add evaporated milk on my bowl. Makes the pudding less thick and the unserved pudding won't be runny. (Like the rice sweat all of the chocolate liquids)",
            "datePublished": "2012-03-06T06:19:57.680Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
